            "review_title": "Review at Accogliente Restaurant at Vinpearl Resort & Spa Ha Long",
            "review_text": "mansi a\n1 contribution\n0\nBest italian food including Italy\nNov 2025 • Friends\nThe food was the best italian food we ever had, including Italy. Definitely order the pastas. The wait staff is amazing & so so friendly & accommodating. The only problem is getting here. Get to vinpearl hotel & spa and ask them to make a reservation for this restaurant as it is the only way you can get there as this restaurant is on a private island. Having said that, everything was 11/10.\nWritten November 6, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
